  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ereferral-priority</b></p><a name=\"ereferral-priority\"> </a><a name=\"hcereferral-priority\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-request-priority.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/request-priority</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 4.0.1, the version found through the package references\"> version ?4.0.1</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-request-priority.html#request-priority-routine\">routine</a></td><td>Routine</td><td>The request has normal priority.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-request-priority.html#request-priority-urgent\">urgent</a></td><td>Urgent</td><td>The request should be actioned promptly - higher priority than routine.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-request-priority.html#request-priority-stat\">stat</a></td><td>STAT</td><td>The request should be actioned immediately - highest possible priority.  E.g. an emergency.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
